source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T00:53:39-07:00","id":939992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/595179-beast-inspiration?p=939580#post939580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bSort of. She has her own free will, and can manifested physically away from her &quot;host&quot;, but if her &quot;host&quot; is destroyed...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah the &quot;Beast&quot; would still need the Hero... It is still only a Part of her soul after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-14T16:16:25-07:00","id":950780,"title":"","content":"<b>Case 39</b><br /> <br /> Child service worker takes to fight for new abused kid. But she did not know that girl is ruthless Tyrant that will change her life in to living Hell. And so child protector need to become kidslayer, i.e. the Hero. Nicely twisted movie. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ok-5lWGBQr8\" data-code=\"Ok-5lWGBQr8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Ok-5lWGBQr8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T20:08:18-07:00","id":981231,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/nosleep/comments/55r2ag/from_1994_to_1997_i_was_the_backseat_killer/\" target=\"_blank\">Here's a story I found today.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T20:19:32-07:00","id":981238,"title":"","content":"Whoops, double post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1423,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","user":"espritdecalmar","date":".  Whoops, double post. 10-05-2016, 09:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T10:01:19-08:00","id":1174054,"title":"","content":"I guess I'll resurrect this thread. I'm sure there's probably a more recent version, but if so, I overlooked it.<br /> <br /> I'd like to to recommend &quot;The Devil is a Part-Timer!&quot;, which is a series of novels, two mangas, and an anime series. The basic premise is that Devil King Satan escapes to our world after being defeated by the Hero Emilia, only to find himself stuck in human form. His new plan for world domination involves gaining a part-time job at a fast food restaurant and becoming a model employee. This is complicated by the fact that the Hero has followed him, and now stalks him so that she can catch him in an evil act and destroy him. I think this show nicely illustrates the relationship that could exist between a somewhat benevolent Tyrant and a Hero with a conscience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T10:03:37-08:00","id":1174057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/595179-beast-inspiration?p=1174054#post1174054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I guess I'll resurrect this thread. I'm sure there's probably a more recent version, but if so, I overlooked it.<br /> <br /> I'd like to to recommend &quot;The Devil is a Part-Timer!&quot;, which is a series of novels, two mangas, and an anime series. The basic premise is that Devil King Satan escapes to our world after being defeated by the Hero Emilia, only to find himself stuck in human form. His new plan for world domination involves gaining a part-time job at a fast food restaurant and becoming a model employee. This is complicated by the fact that the Hero has followed him, and now stalks him so that she can catch him in an evil act and destroy him. I think this show nicely illustrates the relationship that could exist between a somewhat benevolent Tyrant and a Hero with a conscience.</div> </div> </div> </div>I second this, both as Beast inspiration and as a very good anime to watch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T11:22:09-08:00","id":1174080,"title":"","content":"I'd like to recommend both the graphic novel &quot;I Kill Giants&quot; and the book/movie &quot;A Monster Calls&quot;. The latter was already mentioned in this thread, but now I can agree how much pertinent it is.<br /> <br /> They both rely quite a bit on the twist at their end (though it's not hard to spot them) so I won't spoil it, but they're both works about kids dealings with the bad side of life and getting through them by coming to terms with it through the harsh lessons and truth carried over by monsters. It's not clear how much is true and how much is immagination at the end, but that's not the point.<br /> <br /> What matters is that they're both good and, for what involves us, nice examples of Anakim doing their thing, making people deal with their hopelessness and learn lessons about it.<br /> <br /> There are many parallels between the two, so I think I can mention them together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T11:24:38-08:00","id":1174081,"title":"","content":"It's not so relevant to Beasts, but the novel <i>The Song of Achilles</i>, besides being a fantastic - is heart-rending - read, offers some nice insights into the Heroic mindset, as well as what it might be like to be a 'sidekick' who the Hero genuinely cares about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T22:39:09-08:00","id":1183171,"title":"","content":"The manga <i>Majin Tantei Nougami Neuro</i>\u200b is great inspiration of how to be a Beast and help people without necessarily having a &quot;just&quot; motive. The title character solves murder mysteries, not to help people, but because he literally feeds off the murderous will of a pre-meditated murderer. Heck, the extent Neuro's dedication to his hunger lines up perfectly with a Beast's; at one point it's revealed that his hunger is so strong, he's effectively chosen eating over breathing.<br /> <br /> Many of Neuro's powers also resemble nightmares and atavisms, either breaking his opponents brains or revealing the more inhuman features of his body, allowing him to uncover details his opponents have carefully hidden.<br /> <br /> \u200bNeuro would definitely an Ugallu (given how he leaves killers feeling naked and vulnerable) and Ravager (He shows no interest in actually punishing criminals, only in solving the puzzles their crimes make).<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200bMeanwhile, the main villain of the series, Sicks, is a perfect example of an Insatiable. Just look at the things the man does, I won't spoil it for anyone who wants to enjoy the series for themselves.<br /> \u200bWARNING, the anime ended before the manga finished, so the endings are <i>very different</i>.<br /> <br /> ==Edit==<br /> <br /> \u200bWith the BPG released, I want to add a little to this post:<br /> \u200bNeuro might also count as a hunger for Whispers (since he reveals a criminals secrets and methods)<br /> \u200bAlso, Yako would definitely be a Herald, especially after what happened during the Kamigiri incident.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":17107,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","user":"Mangaholic13","date":". 03-10-2018, 12:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-14T07:06:57-08:00","id":1185935,"title":"","content":"For me, the biggest source of inspiration for Beast has been Legendary's take on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AkcfB3z0_-0\" target=\"_blank\">Godzilla</a>. He's likened to a force of nature because of the destruction he causes by simply <b>moving</b>. As much as the human cast is horrified by Godzilla, they can't help but be awed by this primordial apex predator.<br /> <br /> The idea of a Beast/Horror so awe inspiring in how terrifying it is became the inspiration for my Anakim Ravager.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23824-adorablechou","name":"AdorableChou","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T00:24:50-07:00","id":1216527,"title":"","content":"I watched &quot;Take Shelter&quot; over the weekend and while it's a slow burn I think it's an excellent depiction of an Anakim's victim, particularly a &quot;force of nature&quot; kind of Anakim.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10272,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","user":"Daigotsu Max","date":". 05-08-2018, 03:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-10T04:00:16-07:00","id":1217325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AdorableChou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/595179-beast-inspiration?p=1185935#post1185935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For me, the biggest source of inspiration for Beast has been Legendary's take on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AkcfB3z0_-0\" target=\"_blank\">Godzilla</a>. He's likened to a force of nature because of the destruction he causes by simply <b>moving</b>. As much as the human cast is horrified by Godzilla, they can't help but be awed by this primordial apex predator.<br /> <br /> The idea of a Beast/Horror so awe inspiring in how terrifying it is became the inspiration for my Anakim Ravager.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ow Lord... My brain did a thing....<br /> <br /> Godzilla is what happens if a Deviant is Devoured......<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> To Clarify (I find brainstorming like this Fun) The Deviant was likely hunted and nearly killed in/near an Island, one of the Local Beast found an... Odd Kin (probably never meet something like them before) and tried to save them, the Rage and strength they had made them tap into the Dream and made them into something Else, Nearly instantly sending them into an Inheritance (Rampancy Probaly) this being a Deviant (from what we know of them) they step into a Spiral of power and growth and constantly redefine themselves.<br /> I'm thinking this would end up as the equivalent of Shin Godzilla....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":3981,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","user":"RickmanUK","date":". 05-10-2018, 08:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T10:11:12-07:00","id":1229388,"title":"","content":"Not the whole movie, but the &quot;Fear Simulation&quot; scenes from Divergent could make for a good application of Lair Traits - or Nightmares taking effect.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-24T00:59:41-07:00","id":1229759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AdorableChou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/595179-beast-inspiration?p=1185935#post1185935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For me, the biggest source of inspiration for Beast has been Legendary's take on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AkcfB3z0_-0\" target=\"_blank\">Godzilla</a>. He's likened to a force of nature because of the destruction he causes by simply <b>moving</b>. As much as the human cast is horrified by Godzilla, they can't help but be awed by this primordial apex predator.<br /> <br /> The idea of a Beast/Horror so awe inspiring in how terrifying it is became the inspiration for my Anakim Ravager.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I was under the impression that Godzilla was an allegory for nuclear warfare.<br /> <br /> From what I understand, his body is so toxic that he spreads radiation poisoning everywhere he goes. Which means those people should probably evacuate the fucking city every time he shows up!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T13:32:17-07:00","id":1230092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/595179-beast-inspiration?p=1229759#post1229759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> I was under the impression that Godzilla was an allegory for nuclear warfare.<br /> <br /> From what I understand, his body is so toxic that he spreads radiation poisoning everywhere he goes. Which means those people should probably evacuate the fucking city every time he shows up!</div> </div> </div> </div>Original Gojira was, yes. By now, that allegory has undergone some... fluctuations, let's call it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T10:16:29-07:00","id":1240112,"title":"","content":"Necro: The upcoming movie &quot;The Mermaid&quot; looks like it could be used for a particularly vicious Makara.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T11:01:47-07:00","id":1240142,"title":"","content":"Seems interesting can you give me a link?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T11:23:05-07:00","id":1240146,"title":"","content":"A quote from Evgeny Schwartz' play <i>The Dragon</i> , which I think could be very inspirational for a Tyrant of some description:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;You see, the human soul is very resilient. Cut the body in half \u2014 and the man croaks. But tear the soul apart \u2014 and it only becomes more pliable, that's all. No, really, you couldn't pick a finer assortment of souls anywhere. Only in my town. Souls with no hands. Souls with no legs. Mute souls, deaf souls, chained souls, snitch souls, damned souls.&quot;</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T12:49:50-07:00","id":1240177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/595179-beast-inspiration?p=1240142#post1240142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems interesting can you give me a link?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuFu7zJ4NJs\" target=\"_blank\">Here you go.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T02:14:29-07:00","id":1240364,"title":"","content":"So finally got around to watching Babylon 5. Mr. Mordin is either a perfect enabler or an interesting tyrant. Actually I suppose you could take Mordin as the enabler with the Shadows as the Tyrant. To put a simple way Mordin asked a person what they wanted, he got the answer and with just demonstration indebted the person into a position they didn't like. The Shadows are ancient and absurdly powerful to the point where its basically one Shadow ship to crush any army sent against it. (This is all season 2 stuff when the Shadows are basically just things that show up and decimate, so I don't know how they'll fair in a more open conflict when that crops up.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T09:06:58-07:00","id":1241859,"title":"","content":"Crypt TV has tons of stuff that is pretty cool.<br /> Didn't we have a 'nightmare triggered by whoever eats this' somewhere? <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ld_w6sz45hg\" target=\"_blank\">Black Sugar</a> would fit that bill quiet well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T22:12:51-07:00","id":1242873,"title":"","content":"Majora's Mask...<br /> <br /> Just... the entire game and everything in it!<br /> <br /> Or would that be more suitable for Changeling?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}